#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: includes/class-saito-swatches-admin.php:118 includes/class-saito-swatches-admin.php:498 includes/class-saito-swatches-product.php:396
msgid "Saito Swatches"
msgstr "Saito Swatches"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://wordpress.org/plugins/saito-swatches/"
msgstr "https://fr.wordpress.org/plugins/saito-swatches/"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid "Replace WooCommerce variation dropdowns with image swatches and show a unit price (e.g. per 100 ml). Everything is editable from the admin, no template override needed."
msgstr "Remplace les listes déroulantes des variations WooCommerce par des vignettes images et affiche un prix unitaire (ex. au 100 ml). Tout se règle depuis l’administration, sans surcharge de template."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "Troteseil Lucas"
msgstr "Troteseil Lucas"

#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "https://profiles.wordpress.org/lucastsl/"
msgstr "https://profiles.wordpress.org/lucastsl/"

